{"id": "1834140", "name": "חקירת פונקציה רציונלית – אסימפטוטה ושתי נקודות קיצון", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "ff", "params": ["x"], "body": "r*(x-c)*(x-a)/(x-b)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V6_VISIBLE_VALIDATION\">\n<div style=\"background: #f4f1f5; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #4b1f6f;\">חקירת פונקציה רציונלית – אסימפטוטה ושתי נקודות קיצון</strong></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">הפונקציה</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)=\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:1}}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">תחום ההגדרה</strong>\n<p>מצאו את נקודת אי־ההגדרה.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle x_1=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">נקודות קיצון</strong>\n<p>מצאו את שתי הנקודות שבהן הנגזרת מתאפסת וסווגו אותן.</p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\) [[input:point1]]</div>\n<div>[[input:classification1]]</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:point1]]</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\) [[input:point2]]</div>\n<div>[[input:classification2]]</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:point2]]</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">גבולות ליד האסימפטוטה</strong>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to x_1^+}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to x_1^-}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">התנהגות באינסוף</strong>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans7]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans7]]</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 6px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans8]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">[[validation:ans8]]</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">בחרו את הגרף</strong>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>גרף 1<br>{{CT:2}}</td>\n<td>גרף 2<br>{{CT:3}}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>גרף 3<br>{{CT:4}}</td>\n<td>גרף 4<br>{{CT:5}}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans9]]</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stack-required-validation\">[[validation:classification1]][[validation:classification2]][[validation:ans9]]</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V6_VISIBLE_VALIDATION\">\n<div style=\"background: #f4f1f5; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</strong></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; margin: 8px 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון</strong>\n<p>נקודת אי־ההגדרה היא \\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:6}}\\). הנגזרת מתאפסת ב־\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:7}}\\) וב־\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:8}}\\).</p>\n<p>הגבולות ליד האסימפטוטה הם {{CT:9}} ו־{{CT:10}}; באינסוף הם {{CT:11}} ו־{{CT:12}}. הגרף הנכון הוא גרף {{CT:13}}.</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "x", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "x", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type